                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Chanced upon this cafe as we were shopping in the area, really recommended checking it out!\n\nGot a cappuccino and a hot milk tea\n\nThe coffee was gr888, good coffee and beautiful latte art. There’s cocoa powder added on the cappuccino foam too.\n\nHot milk tea was nice and interesting; there’s a thick layer of milk foam at the top, milk tea below. Tasted 👍🏻\n\nService is great; you can tell that each cup of drink was made with sincerity and effort.\n\nReally reco checking the place out!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
