                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJDW94bgCpQjQR2f0ar4hGV3w/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xb1NXZFNTelpsWkZkblZFVXhZMTlOVjBOc1NFRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "2 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This place has legit coffee for coffee people. I saw the barista measuring his grounds precisely and he knew what to do with his La Marzocca. So, I got a latte and then I asked him about the beans and his ratios. He gave me a detailed explanation about the source / elevation. He told me that he used a double ristretto for my latte, which is more detail than I get from my baristas in the US, who are basically following a recipe. And then he gave me a full espresso and a ristretto to compare the nuanced differences. I’d say he was showing off how high quality his beans are. Very appreciated. I could also tell he appreciated being able to talk to someone who appreciates his effort.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
